          "relation": "same",
          "evidence": "The module introduction, lesson source scopes, final lesson step and blind reconstruction consistently preserve this boundary. The words identifying the same gradient are justified as retention of the same parameter D; they must not be read as proving a converse characterization or independently verifying external resolvent wiring."
        },
        {
          "slot": "constant dependencies",
          "original": "The local identity contains no Poincaré, curvature, spectral-gap or complexity constant; the normalization of the density is implicit in proportionality.",
