      "subtitle": "companion:sphmc-rgo-calculus · equivalent-after-elaboration",
      "summary": "Blind reconstruction and seven-slot semantic comparison for AutoSamplingTheory.ExampleCases.SmoothedPicardHMC.RGOCalculus.rgo_calculus.",
