          "relation": "explicit-elaboration",
          "evidence": "κ⁻¹+r is strictly positive, including r=0. This supplies the integrability argument. In positive dimension the sandwich also forces κ≥1; the disclosed zero-dimensional extension need not satisfy that extra inequality."
