          "relation": "equivalent",
          "evidence": "The full four-step lesson and module maintain this boundary. The reflection test is a separate deterministic measure-preservation consequence, consistent with the adjacent source discussion, not a process-invariance result. No conditional kernel or complexity quantity occurs in the production statement. The publication role is proof-edge for the three named obligations, not credit for all of Section 2.2 or the paper's main theorem."
