          "reconstructed": "C_eta=((sqrt(2*pi*eta))^-1)^Module.finrank R E; the final factor is C_eta/Z_V, and the exponent is -V(x)-norm(y-x)^2/(2*eta). The map uses sqrt(eta) times the centered identity-covariance Gaussian.",
