          "evidence": "The current scoped parameters and formal statement impose exactly this structure. The volume normalization is fixed by the inner product, not an arbitrary chosen Haar scale. In dimension zero, all points coincide, the quadratic exponent is zero and the normalizer is raised to the zeroth power; density one is consistent with unit canonical volume."
