          "relation": "explicit-elaboration",
          "evidence": "Precision zero represents the source's infinite initial variance, not a zero initial variance. The conclusion explicitly gives J>0 and r_J⁻¹>0. source_log_domain and the final proof establish positive domains rather than relying on totalized inverse/log behavior."
