      "search": "semantic-audit:astis-rt-20260911-pbpsreflectionl2 semantic-audit astis-rt-20260911-pbpsreflectionl2 companion:pbps-reflection-l2 · domain-mismatch blind reconstruction and seven-slot semantic comparison for autosamplingtheory.examplecases.proximalbps.reflectionl2.actual_reflection_block_identities. domain-mismatch source hidden from decoder the paper uses the normalized gibbs target on r^d, d≥1, with c² potential v and hessian bounds 0<αi≤∇²v≤βi, and 0<η≤1/β. its joint law has density proportional to exp(−v(x)−‖y−x‖²/(2η)). the selected block-algebra component acts on real l² of this joint law. p is conditional expectation given y and u is pullback by (x,y)↦(x,2x−y). the conditional resampling operator is the orthogonal projection p onto functions of y. reflection pullback u is a self-adjoint unitary. with a=pup, b=(i−p)up and d=(i−p)u(i−p), the block identities are b*b=i−a² on the range of p and b*d=−ab*. consequently ‖bf‖²=‖f‖²−‖af‖² for f in that range. the full-space extension of the first identity has p in place of i. 任取有限维实内积空间 e，赋予其 borel 可测结构；任取 e 上概率测度 μ 和 η>0。γ_e 是标准中心高斯。j 是独立 x~μ、z~γ_e 的 (x,x+sqrt(η)z) 联合分布。令 h=l²(e×e,j;ℝ)，f(x,y)=(x,2x−y)，p 为第二坐标生成子 sigma 代数的可测 l² 子空间上的正交投影，再包含回 h。 存在 markov 核 r:e→e，对每个 y，r(y,dx)=exp(−‖x−y‖²/(2η))μ(dx)/∫exp(−‖z−y‖²/(2η))μ(dz)。markov 核含可测性及每个 r_y 为概率的要求。 对于该核还存在实线性等距 u:h→h，使对每个 f，uf=f∘f j-a.e.，u(uf)=f，u*=u，并且对每个 f，pf(x,y)=∫f(z,y)r(y,dz) j-a.e.。 定义 a=pup，b=(i−p)up，d=(i−p)u(i−p)。整个 h 上 b*b=p−a²，b*d=−ab*。每个 pf=f 的 f 满足 ‖bf‖²=‖f‖²−‖af‖²。 倾斜核公式对所有 y 成立；代表元公式只 j-a.e.，零测例外集可依赖 f。f、uf、pf 是模 a.e. 等价类，函数公式用选定代表元；命题未另断言所有固定 y 的切片都可积。能量等式只在 p 的范围断言；算子等式在整个 h 成立。乘法是右侧先作用的复合，star 为 hilbert 伴随。r,u 在给定 e,μ,η 后存在，同一组见证满足全部结论，无显式唯一性断言。没有额外密度、光滑性或矩条件，局部 let/have 是定义非假设。精确常数为 sqrt(η)、反射系数2、指数分母2η和能量单位系数，无其他常数或维数依赖系数。 accepted appendix b.1, equations b.1 and b.3–b.5; joint density 2.6 autosamplingtheory.examplecases.proximalbps.reflectionl2.actual_reflection_block_identities autosamplingtheory/examplecases/proximalbps/reflectionl2.lean true root-samplinglib-writer reflection_blind_decoder 357a6e44a8fe089514ba0d0ea6c3777b6043a04edfdbfe2ab39e4e90bdaba6c0 accepted log_depth_source_review objects augmented gibbs law, conditional projection given y, reflection pullback and micro-macro blocks. actual gaussian j, explicitly defined condexpl2 projection p, reflection u and a=pup,b=(i-p)up,d=(i-p)u(i-p). explicit-elaboration j,f,p are definitions. reflection_lift and projection_kernel consume the actual preservation and conditional-kernel parents; gibbs consumer rewrites normalized_augmentation_density. domains source gibbs target on finite-dimensional euclidean space and its l². arbitrary probability μ on finite-dimensional real inner-product borel e, η>0 and real l²(j), including zero dimension. stronger-in-lean broader domain is disclosed in lesson and candidate assumptions; test specializes exact source density. block algebra needs neither positive dimension, upper hessian bound nor upper scale restriction. quantifiers all l² observables; energy on macroscopic subspace. for every e,μ,η common witnesses r,u; all y have kernel formula; each f has j-a.e. identities; every pf=f has energy equality. explicit-elaboration existential witnesses precede observable quantifiers; no exchange with common exceptional set and no loss of pf=f. assumptions c² gibbs curvature and 0<η≤1/β in source context. general theorem only probability and positive scale; gibbs consumer retains c² and genuine positive hessian lower bound. stronger-in-lean disclosed generalization for algebraic component only. positive zv from normalized_augmentation_density excludes nonintegrability via integral_undef, then isprobabilitymeasure_tilted; no conditional law or integrability assumed. conclusion self-adjoint unitary reflection and compressed block identities b.5. isometric involutive self-adjoint u, actual kernel projection, full-space b*b=p-a²,b*d=-ab*, and macroscopic energy. equivalent isometry plus involution is surjective. 