          "relation": "explicit-elaboration",
          "evidence": "The module, binding and lesson preserve this scope. No operator-norm differentiability or identification with the old PUP L² representative is asserted."
        },
        {
          "slot": "constant dependencies",
          "original": "Midpoint, reflection and Gaussian coefficients in density and score.",
          "reconstructed": "Coefficients 2,1/2,8eta and -1/(4eta), with derived local Gaussian constants.",
          "relation": "explicit-elaboration",
          "evidence": "Jacobian 2^(-dim E) cancels. The proof uses m=V(0)-G²/(2alpha), a=1/(16eta), R=norm(y0)+1, C=exp(-m+R²/(8eta)), b=(beta+eta^(-1))/4, A=G/2+bR and envelope C(A+b(1+2/a))exp(-a norm(u)^2/2). These are proof constants, not source variance constants."
        }
