      "search": "semantic-audit:astis-rt-20260912-sphmcjointreferencegradientdescent semantic-audit astis-rt-20260912-sphmcjointreferencegradientdescent companion:sphmc-joint-reference-gradient-descent · domain-mismatch blind reconstruction and seven-slot semantic comparison for autosamplingtheory.examplecases.smoothedpicardhmc.jointreferencegradientdescent.joint_reference_gradient_descent. domain-mismatch source hidden from decoder e is a complete finite-dimensional real inner-product space with its borel measurable structure and canonical volume. its real dimension d is strictly positive. u:e->r is c2. alpha,beta are nonnegative reals with 0<alpha<=beta. the genuine hessian obeys alpha*norm(v)^2<=d2u(x)[v,v]<=beta*norm(v)^2 for every x,v. eta>=0,tau>0,r>=0. the actual probability nu satisfies w2(nu,rho_eta)^2<=ofreal(r^2), where pi=volume.tilted(-u) and rho_eta is the law of x+sqrt(eta)*z for independent x~pi,z~stdgaussian(e). w2 is the actual infimum of quadratic coupling costs. set a=eta+tau,a=alpha+1/a,c=beta+1/a,k=c/a,m=4*beta*d+4*beta^2*eta*d+2*beta^2*r^2. for p=(y,z), set u(p)=y+sqrt(tau)*z and f_p(x)=u(x)+norm(x-u(p))^2/(2*a). use t_p(x)=x-c^(-1)*grad f_p(x), start at y, and define n(p) as the least n with norm(grad f_p(t_p^n(y)))^2<=a*d if one exists, otherwise zero. define out(p)=t_p^n(p)(y). the finite-hit proof makes the default branch unreachable for every pair. the actual inner stopping index n and output out are jointly measurable in the pair. for every pair the output satisfies gradient-square<=a*d, residual norm= a*norm(grad f_p(out))<=a*sqrt(a*d), every earlier index strictly fails the threshold, and n+1<=2+k*log(1+a*norm(grad f_p(y))^2/d). under the actual nu.prod(stdgaussian(e)), n+1 is integrable and its expectation is at most 2+k*log(1+a*(m+tau*d/a^2)/d). 设 \\(e\\) 是完备的有限维实内积空间，带有与其拓扑一致的 borel 可测结构。记 \\[ d=\\dim_{\\mathbb r}e, \\] 并假设 \\(d>0\\)。 设 \\(u:e\\to\\mathbb r\\) 二次连续可微，非负实数 \\(\\alpha,\\beta\\) 满足 \\(0<\\alpha\\le\\beta\\)，且对所有 \\(x,v\\in e\\)， \\[ \\alpha\\|v\\|^2 \\le d^2u(x)[v,v] \\le\\beta\\|v\\|^2. \\] 这里 \\(d^2u\\) 是实际的二阶 fréchet 导数。 任取实数 \\(\\eta,\\tau,r\\)，满足 \\[ \\eta\\ge0,\\qquad \\tau>0,\\qquad r\\ge0. \\] 令 \\(g\\) 为 \\(e\\) 上均值为零、协方差为恒等算子的标准高斯概率测度，\\(\\lambda\\) 为该内积空间的 lebesgue 体积测度。定义测度 \\[ \\mu=\\lambda.\\mathrm{tilted}(-u). \\] 按照提供的定义，其相对于 \\(\\lambda\\) 的密度是 \\[ x\\longmapsto \\operatorname{ofreal}\\!\\left( \\frac{e^{-u(x)}}{\\int_e e^{-u(y)}\\,d\\lambda(y)} \\right). \\] 这里分母是具有库中总定义约定的实 bochner 积分：不可积时积分取零，实数除以零取零。因此，此处定义本身不额外附加分母正且有限或 \\(\\mu\\) 归一化的假设。 令 \\[ g_\\eta=(z\\mapsto\\sqrt{\\eta}\\,z)_\\#g,\\qquad \\rho=(x,z\\mapsto x+z)_\\#(\\mu\\otimes g_\\eta). \\] 任取 \\(e\\) 上概率测度 \\(\\nu\\)。令 \\[ i=\\inf\\left\\{ \\int_{e\\times e}^{-} \\operatorname{ofreal}(\\|x-y\\|^2)\\,d\\gamma(x,y): \\gamma\\text{ 是 }e\\times e\\text{ 上测度， } \\gamma_1=\\nu,\\ \\gamma_2=\\rho \\right\\}, \\] 其中积分和下确界均在扩展非负实数中取值。假设 \\[ \\bigl(i^{1/2}\\bigr)^2\\le\\operatorname{ofreal}(r^2). \\] 内层 \\(1/2\\) 次幂为扩展非负实数的实指数幂，外层平方为自然数幂。 定义实数 \\[ a=\\eta+\\tau,\\qquad a=\\alpha+a^{-1},\\qquad c=\\beta+a^{-1},\\qquad k=\\frac ca, \\] 以及 \\[ m=4\\beta d+4\\beta^2\\eta d+2\\beta^2r^2. \\] 对每一个参数对 \\(p=(y,z)\\in e\\times e\\)，定义 \\[ u_p=y+\\sqrt{\\tau}\\,z,\\qquad f_p(x)=u(x)+\\frac{1}{2a}\\|x-u_p\\|^2, \\] 以及梯度迭代映射 \\[ t_p(x)=x-\\frac1c\\nabla f_p(x). \\] 梯度始终针对状态变量 \\(x\\) 求取，参数 \\(p\\) 固定。令 \\[ x_{p,0}=y,\\qquad x_{p,n+1}=t_p(x_{p,n}). \\] 若存在自然数 \\(n\\) 使 \\[ \\|\\nabla f_p(x_{p,n})\\|^2\\le ad, \\] 则定义 \\(n(p)\\) 为满足该不等式的最小自然数；若不存在，则定义 \\(n(p)=0\\)。定义输出 \\[ \\operatorname{out}(p)=x_{p,n(p)}. \\] 结论同时包括： 1. \\(n:e\\times e\\to\\mathbb n\\) 和 \\(\\operatorname{out}:e\\times e\\to e\\) 都可测。 2. 对所有 \\(p\\in e\\times e\\)，均有 \\[ \\|\\nabla f_p(\\operatorname{out}(p))\\|^2\\le ad, \\] \\[ \\|u_p-a\\nabla u(\\operatorname{out}(p))-\\operatorname{out}(p)\\| =a\\|\\nabla f_p(\\operatorname{out}(p))\\|, \\] \\[ \\|u_p-a\\nabla u(\\operatorname{out}(p))-\\operatorname{out}(p)\\| \\le a\\sqrt{ad}. \\] 对每一个自然数 \\(j<n(p)\\)，还有严格不等式 \\[ ad<\\|\\nabla f_p(x_{p,j})\\|^2. \\] 因而每个参数对都实际达到停止条件，定义中的“未命中则取零”分支不会造成未达标输出。 3. 对所有 \\(p=(y,z)\\)，计数满足 \\[ n(p)+1 \\le k\\log\\!\\left( 1+\\frac{a\\|\\nabla f_p(y)\\|^2}{d} \\right)+2. \\] 此处 \\(n(p)\\) 是从初值出发执行的更新次数；结论直接控制的是 \\(n(p)+1\\)，包含初始状态的检查位置。若初值已满足停止条件，则 \\(n(p)=0\\)，该计数为 \\(1\\)。 4. 实值函数 \\(p\\mapsto n(p)+1\\) 关于实际乘积概率测度 \\(\\nu\\otimes g\\) bochner 可积，而且 \\[ \\int_{e\\times e}(n(p)+1)\\,d(\\nu\\otimes g)(p) \\le 2+k\\log\\!\\left( 1+\\frac{a\\left(m+\\tau d/a^2\\right)}{d} \\right). \\] 因此随机输入可理解为相互独立的 \\(y\\sim\\nu\\) 与 \\(z\\sim g\\)。点态结论适用于所有参数对，积分结论则针对这一特定乘积测度。 该陈述没有给出输出的分布等于某个目标测度、输出误差的分布距离界、精确最小化结论、运行时间的尾界，或额外随机抽样步骤。它也没有把梯度调用、函数调用、算术操作等具体实现成本定义为 \\(n+1\\)；所直接控制的是上述数学计数。没有单独列出 \\(\\operatorname{out}\\)、\\(u\\) 或梯度的可积性结论，也没有单独陈述 \\(\\mu\\) 的归一化定理。 accepted section6.3 reference point construction: actual inner stopping and expected count autosamplingtheory.examplecases.smoothedpicardhmc.jointreferencegradientdescent.joint_reference_gradient_descent autosamplingtheory/examplecases/smoothedpicardhmc/jointreferencegradientdescent.lean true root-samplinglib-writer blind_reconstruction_t 68f108d8856b66a582d2c6be544f6e394148975db021dad011cf4eb0c0c23eae accepted log_depth_source_review objects random-center regularized potential,actual gd and reference point. same pair defines initial state,center,true gradient iteration,first index and output. explicit-elaboration u(y,z)=y+sqrt(tau)*z,initial y; derivative in state variable. domains normalized positive-dimensional euclidean source setting. general beta,coordinate-free finite dimension,eta0 allowed,d>0 required. different disclosed extensions;alpha>0 and alpha<=beta exclude beta0. quantifiers current call and independent fresh gaussian. all pair stopping properties at fixed parameters; expectation under actual nu.prod(g). explicit-elaboration no history-conditional law or joint all-parameter kernel conclusion. assumptions curvature and upstream wasserstein accuracy. actual c2 hessian,positive parameters and actual coupling-defined w2 squared budget. explicit-elaboration initial joint moment derived by parent rather than additionally assumed; w2 remains supplied. conclusion actual inner reference and per-call cost use. joint measurability,actual ad first-hit,residual,pointwise count,count l1 and expected bound. explicit-elaboration strict d/a only provides witness; correct residual a*sqrt(ad). scopes one-call step in complete reference-cost argument. fixed-call actual stopping program and mathematical count. explicit-elaboration no history propagation,stage sum,runtime tail or full sampler claim. constant dependencies asymptotic source per-call bound. explicit sufficient2+k*log(1+a*(m+tau*d/a^2)/d). explicit-elaboration looser bound follows strict stopping witness; not source exact count formula. conclusion informational actual ad algorithm retained; auxiliary d/a witness only. independent formal reviewer accepted: actual ad algorithm retained; auxiliary d/a witness only. constant_dependencies informational explicit looser logarithmic bound is derived,not source exact count. independent formal reviewer accepted: explicit looser logarithmic bound is derived,not source exact count. domains informational general beta,coordinate-free and eta0 extensions justify domain-mismatch;d>0 retained. independent formal reviewer accepted: general beta,coordinate-free and eta0 extensions justify domain-mismatch;d>0 retained. assumptions informational actual w2 input supplied,not an upstream sampler guarantee. independent formal reviewer accepted: actual w2 input supplied,not an upstream sampler guarantee. scopes informational n+1 is visited-point mathematical count; gradient-query interpretation needs one base gradient per point reused between check/update,no evaluator trace. independent formal reviewer accepted: n+1 is visited-point mathematical count; gradient-query interpretation needs one base gradient per point reused between check/update,no evaluator trace. scopes