          "evidence": "The primary source asks broader comparisons, but the pinned item excludes them. At N=0, z=1 and the exact gap is beta/4, which exceeds beta/16. This harmless extension does not apply the source upper expression at N=0. There is no optimal-constant, fixed-objective asymptotic, or general-oracle claim."
