          "relation": "explicit-elaboration",
          "evidence": "ProperSpace permits the existing compact-minimization parent; InnerProductSpace and CompleteSpace permit the genuine gradient parent. The small-error premises imply beta>0 and delta>0. Radius zero and large tolerance are not covered; the lesson and candidate assumptions disclose this."
        },
        {
