      "subtitle": "statistical-optimal-transport:Theorem-7.6 · equivalent-after-elaboration",
      "summary": "Blind reconstruction and seven-slot semantic comparison for AutoSamplingTheory.TechnicalLemmas.Measure.DisplacementInterpolationConstantSpeed.wassersteinDistance_interpolation_eq_of_le_of_integrable_norm_sq.",
