        },
        {
          "slot": "assumptions",
          "original": "V is C2, kappa>=1, kappa^(-1)I<=Hess V<=I, 0<eta<=c<1, eps>0, xstar is a minimizer, the combined state energy is integrable with expectation at most M, |t_i|<=1, innovation moments are at most d, and weight row sums are at most S.",
