        {
          "slot": "conclusion",
          "original": "Under identical momentum, the q=2 phase quadratic transport cost is bounded by the position second moment, an intermediate step behind Lemma 4.16.",
          "reconstructed": "The exact squared phase Kantorovich value of the specified product laws is at most the position second moment about xref.",
          "relation": "equivalent",
          "evidence": "The Lean proof constructs the same-momentum coupling and integrates its exact paper metric cost."
        },
