          "reconstructed": "The theorem consumes an existing SatisfiesLogSobolev witness and explicit pair-domain identities, and concludes only KL finiteness plus the KL--Fisher inequality.",
          "relation": "same",
          "evidence": "The full-module documentation and theorem body contain no construction of LSI, strong convexity argument, T2 inequality, or W2 conclusion."
