          "reconstructed": "The bound remains exactly integral epsilon dmu, independently of S and the sizes of the state spaces.",
          "relation": "same",
          "evidence": "The composed intermediate measures are both probabilities, so the eventwise total-variation convention has factor-one Markov contraction. The proof forwards hKL unchanged; associativity introduces neither a factor two nor an additional error term."
        }
