      "summary": "Blind reconstruction and seven-slot semantic comparison for AutoSamplingTheory.ExampleCases.SmoothedPicardHMC.InitialGibbsPhaseTransportUnconditional.initial_gibbs_phase_transport_q2_of_hessian_bounds.",
      "column": 7,
