explicitclass targets hv2/hg2/hf2.tolp withaelinks; gradientmemlp witness; all3same-sequence tendstoattop(nhds target). equivalent re projection does not assumecomplexclassrealness; compacttestuniqueness derives actualg, finitebasis assemblesvector limit. actual productmaps/aelinks carryplateau limits. scopes authored omittedanalyticprerequisite; generic scope disclosed, sourceconsumer genuine; no numberedsource theorem/core/bl/main. compact ordinaryvolume triplegraphapproximation only; no roughclassicallaplacian/hessian, weights/core, quantitativetrate/furtherfunctional inequality. equivalent primarypbpsc.1 offerscompactgradientdensity/closedness context, not exactlaplaciangraph theorem. all7shared readersteps/currentbinding retainopenweighted/global boundaries. constant dependencies exactbessel inverse-(2pi)^-2 relation, fourierdir2pii/lapnegative(2pi)^2; no newsourcecomplexity constant. no quantitativeconstant claimed in public; standardgradient/laplacian operators matchapprovedcontext. equivalent private71-207 symbolsbounded1,1,norm(a), scalarfactors attached exactly. finitebasis convergence only, no dimension-freeestimate/maincredit.",
