          "relation": "equivalent",
          "evidence": "rawFirst/rawSecond prove true log/reciprocal Frechet derivatives. normalizedFirst/Second commute integrable operator evaluation, with integrable summands before splitting. Posterior L2 justifies actual mean and covariance_eq_sub, not total undefined moment integrals. Full60-line source Test obtains source V_eta identities and same augmentation backward kernel."
