izer. identical constants; no global drift bound, dimension-dependent estimate or eta/curvature restriction in shared leaf. equivalent true exp(-w)*exp(w)=1 pointwise; finite-basis identities introduce no numerical estimate; empty basis handles0. hk bounded-gradient constant need not be uniform in k; restricted a.e. domination proves true locall2.",
