          "relation": "equivalent",
          "evidence": "W_y(u)=V((y+u)/2)+norm(u-y)^2/(8eta). Reflection pushforward has inverse(y+u)/2 and volume Jacobian2^-d, hence quarter Hessian scaling; no laws/operators identified without adapter."
        },
