pplied certificates. equivalent current complete parent and source/publication ledgers checked; genuine c2→c1 application; literal reflected density ensures same probability for kernel/mean adapter. conclusion actual common j/r/s reflected-law and positive c2 partitions with original dense/closable/exact d_y; for every centered forcing/sequence actual variational family plus strong scaled-function zero. exactly those output conjuncts; forcing integrable/ordinary weak facts/scaled-gradient limit not separately asserted in this public consumer. equivalent full type and proof projection hu_n.1/ht match exactly; decoder accurately distinguishes the narrower conditional output from gibbs output. scopes authored analytic source-consumer prerequisite, not printed source poincare/score variance/bl/main. true selected common conditional laws/fiberwise quantifiers, no joint selector. same strict boundary; no kernel version identity, uniform unscaled bound, score variance, full hessian/core/main/expected-cost composition. equivalent all3 reader steps actual law/domain, literal density transfer and real solutions/limit match production. no ignored future poincare prototype was read or used. constant dependencies exact reflected w_y=v((y+u)/2)+norm(u-y)²/(8eta), map2x-y and source eta cap; quarter hessian differs from unreflected rgo. scaling epsilon_n; no poincare coefficient concluded. same sqrteta joint/map2x-y/denominator8eta/source cap/epsilon_n scaling, no rate or source poincare constant output. equivalent source primary appc1 quarter hessian and unreflected section2.2/sphmc4.1 scales independently reconstructed before current candidate. this theorem only retains source hypotheses; no 4-factor covariance or dirichlet transport is silently claimed.",
