45. domains full finite real hilbert/borel e including0; actual volume partitions, weighted scalar/vector l2(s_y), original dense closable graph. same volume-vs-weighted measures, forall y versions with actual normalized density and exact original c-infinity compact graph. explicit-elaboration source reflected w_y=v((y+z)/2)+norm(z-y)^2/(8eta), actual pushforward/jacobian handled by parent; not sphmc rgo w_y=v(x)+norm(x-y)^2/(2eta). quantifiers exists common r/s before all y; each y provides one original d_y before all closure-domain u and c after y/u. exact simultaneous markov/disintegration/reflection laws; every y law/partition/d, every u in same closure, exists c. equivalent rcases parent at38-42 and uses same d43-49; no new d per u or y-dependent measurable selector. conditional version property retains usual disintegration scope. assumptions v c2, nnreal0<alpha<=beta, actual all-point/all-vector hessian sandwich, eta>0 beta*eta<=1. same hessian and eta binders; actual partition/markov/graph conclusions produced, not supplied. equivalent c2 w_y produced by genuine parent, c2->c1 only at45; full source curvature/eta cap retained even though generic kernel requires neither. test75-100 actual nonquadratic derivative cert and eta1/2. conclusion common genuine j/r/s, all-y normalized positive reflected law/partition, original dense closable closed gradient, forall zero-output u weighted-ae constant. every conjunction reconstructed exactly; weighted ae constancy belongs to same original closure. equivalent full49-line consumer preserves all parent conjuncts and only adds genuine one-way kernel implication, no skipped original d or law. scopes authored analytic prerequisite within pbps conditional route; no full kernel/constants-domain/resolvent/epsilon0/poincare/bl/main/composition. same bounded fiberwise implication and no joint measurable selection/expected-cost or source-main conclusion. explicit-elaboration primary pbps2.2/c.1 plus3 reader steps preserve actual source-to-reflection map. sphmc4.1 merely downstream background, not identification of rgo/reflected law or proof of bl. constant dependencies exact gaussian sqrt eta, reflection2, potential quadratic1/(8eta); source alpha/beta, eta cap and quarter hessian/fourfold dirichlet scaling. same constants and actual integrability/positive partition; no new quantitative kernel/poincare constant. explicit-elaboration nonquadratic test hessian3/4-sin(x)/8 in[5/8,7/8], source[1/2,1], eta1/2; zero dimension retained. no consumer-law/scale conflation.",
