oted numbered pbps/sphmc theorem. no classical laplacian of arbitrary l2 u, local h2, global generator core/bochner, poincare/bl, centered epsilon-zero limit, noncompact constant/linear domain, joint measurable fiber solution/operator choice, macroscopic h1, sphmc full4.1, pbps hypocoercivity, main result, sampling/composition or cost credit. constant dependencies source alpha/beta/eta cap; gaussian denominator8eta, reflection2 and quarter hessian; positiveepsilon. all factors unchanged, actual partition normalization explicit, no new quantitative bound. equivalent true reflected hessian is (hessv((y+z)/2)+eta^-1 i)/4, whereas unreflected denominator is2eta. test uses true conservative curvature[1/2,1] and eta<=1. no operator/constants equality inferred without reflection adapter.",
