          "label": "Mechanism",
          "value": "Coupling optimization and Kantorovich potentials reuse convex duality, with feasibility and topology specific to transport."
        },
        {
          "label": "Hypothesis Map",
          "value": "Retain the exact source hypotheses for no duality gap and attainment; noncompact spaces need extra care."
        },
        {
          "label": "Conclusion Map",
          "value": "Convex conjugacy and variational inequalities feed transport-map stability and entropic duals."
        },
        {
          "label": "Failure Boundary",
          "value": "Equality of optimal values does not by itself give optimizers, smooth potentials, a Monge map or statistical rates."
        },
