        },
        {
          "label": "Hypothesis Map",
          "value": "Keep p (potential regularity), q (oracle derivative access), k (dynamical order) and r (discretization accuracy) independent; specify operator norm and all constants."
        },
        {
          "label": "Conclusion Map",
          "value": "Target a cost-aware upper bound under a fixed oracle, then isolate which improvement really comes from additional smoothness."
