      "id": "transport:discrete-influence",
      "kind": "concept-bridge",
      "label": "Conditional covariance control versus curvature language",
      "status": "proposal",
      "subtitle": "conceptual mirror candidate; independent review pending",
      "summary": "Matrix and covariance inequalities recur, but the useful discrete property is uniform spectral control of conditional influences. This is a structural comparison, not strong convexity on a spin cube.",
      "formula": "\\begin{gathered}\\Psi_\\mu(i,j)=\\frac{\\operatorname{Cov}_\\mu(\\sigma_i,\\sigma_j)}{\\operatorname{Var}_\\mu(\\sigma_i)}\\quad(i\\ne j)\\\\ \\sup_{\\tau\\text{ feasible}}\\lambda_{\\max}(\\Psi_{\\mu^\\tau})\\leq\\eta\\end{gathered}",
      "details": [
